    "body": "> Move `took` to be a separator similar to `via` or `on`.\r\n\r\n@rochdev This is intentional, and not a bug. However, you can change the prefix of this module to whatever you like using your Starship configuration:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n# ~/.config/starship.toml\r\n\r\n[cmd_duration]\r\nprefix = \"via \" # or \"on \"\r\n```\r\n\r\nPersonally, I think that `took` is clearer.",
