    "body": "@johnletey This issue is not about the keyword, as I'm fine with `took`. The problem is that all prefixes related to the fluent interface are all white, except this one which matches the styling of the duration. For example, when the branch is displayed, `on` is white and `master` is purple. To be consistent, `took` should be white and `230ms` should be yellow (or any other configured color).\r\n\r\nAlthough the default is incorrect, this would be less of an issue if it would be configurable but it's not. You can only change the color of the entire string and not the prefix.",
